      "writtenOn": "2016-09-20T17:24:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Don\u0027t Repeat Yourself. This makes it easy for ABI breaking changes to be made in wpa_debug.h without changing the interface here. Instead, make wpa_debug depend on this package.",
