      "lineNbr": 17,
      "author": {
        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-21T16:14:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It has to be other way around here. wpa_supplicant has multiple control interfaces (HIDL, DBUS, socket, etc). We\u0027re only going to be using HIDL in android for O, but we cannot have the internal enum values of wpa_supplicant be dependent on the HIDL interface. This will not be accepted upstream.",
      "parentUuid": "70d83709_3daa3adf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 56
      },
