      "writtenOn": "2016-09-20T17:24:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe a better name would be \u0027FieldSizes\u0027 (or something similar)\n\nAlso, perhaps since some of these, like \u0027SSID_MAX_LEN\u0027 would make sense to be used in other interfaces which use ssids, you should move this enumeration to a types.hal file.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
