      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-21T16:14:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a lot of combinations of these supported by wpa_supplicant. We only use the SIM related ones and they\u0027re explained in the comments below.",
      "parentUuid": "70d83709_d05c3579",
      "range": {
