        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-21T22:16:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changed this generic interface and moved it to separate callbacks for each event type that we\u0027re interested in. This also avoids having to use a union to represent multiple different types of param.",
